    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1755093281\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Last Man in a Failed Toxic Weapon Experiment Zone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world was beginning to heal from the scars of World War I, but no one had given up \u2014 new weapons were still being made. You are Agent 511, a scientist testing toxic weapons on an abandoned village. The radio just sent one final message: <strong>Project failed. Clean the village.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/3fa45dd5abb5f80bbd6fc4eedfc6ac9b.poster.avif?t=1755093281\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/3fa45dd5abb5f80bbd6fc4eedfc6ac9b.webm?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/3fa45dd5abb5f80bbd6fc4eedfc6ac9b.mp4?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project: Fractured Reality</strong> is a first-person survival horror game where you craft, explore, and uncover dark secrets while working to clean the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When you leave the safe house, you are on your own.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you step out of your safe house, the door gets locked, and you have to survive until it opens again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/d0715af909bf66bbde095a72b5c2ae8e.poster.avif?t=1755093281\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/d0715af909bf66bbde095a72b5c2ae8e.webm?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/d0715af909bf66bbde095a72b5c2ae8e.mp4?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft different maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft different maps and find your way through the village. it's the only guide you can rely on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/fd47ea2ed00256647de6769a72d5cb8e.poster.avif?t=1755093281\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/fd47ea2ed00256647de6769a72d5cb8e.webm?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/fd47ea2ed00256647de6769a72d5cb8e.mp4?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive no matter what.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, protect yourself, and purge the village of toxins and the infected who\u2019ve lost their minds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/912ac2eaacbc26dd4a39edac310d955a.poster.avif?t=1755093281\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/912ac2eaacbc26dd4a39edac310d955a.webm?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/912ac2eaacbc26dd4a39edac310d955a.mp4?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting and Resource Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is limited \u2014 craft and manage your resources wisely to survive and complete your duty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/af77b3a6be524d5d0213908bc1ca2ebe.poster.avif?t=1755093281\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/af77b3a6be524d5d0213908bc1ca2ebe.webm?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/af77b3a6be524d5d0213908bc1ca2ebe.mp4?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/af4cd388c3453d3381f22982f580bb47.poster.avif?t=1755093281\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/af4cd388c3453d3381f22982f580bb47.webm?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/af4cd388c3453d3381f22982f580bb47.mp4?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/f338e75d4b7a35eeae9dac5f5758d3b7.poster.avif?t=1755093281\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/f338e75d4b7a35eeae9dac5f5758d3b7.webm?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I'm making this game with love and everything I have.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make sure to wishlist it so you\u2019ll be notified when it\u2019s released!</strong></p>",
