ideo/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/f338e75d4b7a35eeae9dac5f5758d3b7.poster.avif?t=1755093281\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411860/extras/f338e75d4b7a35eeae9dac5f5758d3b7.webm?t=1755093281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I'm making this game with love and everything I have.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make sure to wishlist it so you\u2019ll be notified when it\u2019s released!</strong></p>",
